<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Periodic Projects</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#14162B;
    --card:#1E2140;
    --teal:#4FE0C4;
    --coral:#FF6B4A;
    --gold:#FFC857;
    --paper:#F2F0E9;
    --paper-dim:#B8B7C9;
  }

  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }

  html,body{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh;
  }

  /* faint periodic-table lattice in the background */
  .lattice{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(18, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows:repeat(10, 1fr);
    gap:2px;
    padding:2px;
    opacity:0.06;
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:0;
  }
  .lattice div{
    border:1px solid var(--paper);
    border-radius:3px;
  }

  a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--gold);
    outline-offset:3px;
  }

  header{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:1.75rem clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .wordmark{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    color:var(--paper-dim);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }

  nav a{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    padding:0.55rem 1rem;
    border:1px solid rgba(242,240,233,0.25);
    border-radius:6px;
    transition:border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  nav a:hover{
    border-color:var(--teal);
    background:rgba(79,224,196,0.08);
    transform:translateY(-1px);
  }

  main{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    min-height:calc(100vh - 88px);
    padding:2rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    text-align:center;
    gap:2.5rem;
  }

  /* the hero "element card" */
  .element-card{
    position:relative;
    width:min(320px, 80vw);
    aspect-ratio:1;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg, var(--card), #171933);
    border:2px solid var(--teal);
    border-radius:20px;
    box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(79,224,196,0.15), 0 30px 60px -20px rgba(79,224,196,0.25);
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:1.5rem;
    animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes float{
    0%, 100%{ transform:translateY(0); }
    50%{ transform:translateY(-10px); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .element-card{ animation:none; }
  }

  .atomic-number{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:1.1rem;
    color:var(--gold);
    text-align:left;
  }

  .symbol{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:5rem;
    line-height:1;
    color:var(--paper);
  }

  .element-name{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.8rem;
    letter-spacing:0.15em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--coral);
    text-align:right;
  }

  h1{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.75rem);
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:-0.02em;
  }

  h1 span{ color:var(--teal); }

  .tagline{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size:clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem);
    color:var(--paper-dim);
    max-width:34ch;
    margin:0 auto;
    line-height:1.6;
  }

  .cta{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.6rem;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
    padding:0.9rem 1.6rem;
    background:var(--teal);
    color:var(--ink);
    border-radius:10px;
    font-weight:600;
    transition:transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .cta:hover{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:0 12px 24px -10px rgba(79,224,196,0.5);
  }
  .cta:hover .arrow{ transform:translateX(3px); }
  .arrow{ transition:transform 0.15s ease; }

  footer{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    text-align:center;
    padding:1.5rem;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    color:rgba(184,183,201,0.6);
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="lattice" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header>
    <span class="wordmark">Lab Notebook</span>
    <nav>
      <a href="projects.html">Projects</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="element-card" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="atomic-number">42</span>
      <span class="symbol">Pp</span>
      <span class="element-name">Periodic&nbsp;Projects</span>
    </div>

    <h1>Periodic <span>Projects</span></h1>
    <p class="tagline">A small periodic table of things I've built — stable in some places, wildly reactive in others.</p>

    <a class="cta" href="projects.html">
      View the table <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Est. 2026 &middot; Handle with care
  </footer>

</body>
</html>